   "source": [
    "# Quiz: Introduction to the Data Science Lifecycle\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-14-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is the first step of the data science lifecycle?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Analyzing data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Analysis is a later stage. The first stage, capturing, is getting the data and defining the problem.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Cleaning data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The first stage, capturing, is getting the data and defining the problem to solve.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Acquiring data and the problem to solve</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The first stage, capturing, combines acquiring the data and defining the problem to solve.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-14-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Once the next step of the data science lifecycle is reached, you can't go back to previous steps</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>True</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. You can go back. For example, new findings in the data may lead you to redefine the goals.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>False</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. You can go back, for example to redefine your goals after learning more from the data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-14-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What considerations should be taken when maintaining data?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Cleaning data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Cleaning is part of maintenance, but so is keeping data secure.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Keeping the data secure</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Security is part of maintenance, but so is cleaning the data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>All of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Maintenance includes managing data, like cleaning it, and keeping it secure.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-14-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What step of the data science lifecycle is most likely to produce a model?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Processing</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The processing stage focuses on finding patterns in the data and on modeling.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Maintenance</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Maintenance is about managing, storing and securing data. Models come from processing.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Capturing</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Capturing is about getting the data and defining the problem. Models come from processing.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-14-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What questions would a data scientist ask in the capture phase of the data science lifecycle?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>What are the constraints?</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Does the data make sense?</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Does the model make sense?</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-14-post-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What are some common techniques in the processing stage?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Clustering</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Clustering, which groups data into similar groups, is a common processing technique.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Artificial intelligence</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The common processing techniques are classification, clustering and regression. AI is not on that list.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>All of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Clustering is on the list of common processing techniques, but AI is not.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  }
 ],
